{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkdUwxfx5Eydeu74LpcA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd stop here. The rest is \"who offers it\", and I've got enough.\n\nOkay, so I got roughly: after 6 years I can take it out with no tax, and with 300 from me plus 900 from my boss each month it comes to something like 66 thousand. I'm only fairly sure about that. I'm sure about the 6 years. The money part confused me.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **What I looked at, in order:** First the heading \"קרן השתלמות\" and the line \"אחרי 6 שנים מההפקדה הראשונה אפשר למשוך… בלי מס\". That answered the when. Then I scrolled past a bit about tax limits and some buttons (מסלול כללי, S&P 500…). Then the calculator, \"מה קורה לכסף בקרן\". It has boxes with 2.5% from me, 7.5% from the boss, 7% return and 0.54% fees. Under them is a bar chart up to 12 years, and the marker was sitting on \"5 שנים\".\n- **The confusing part:** Below the chart there are big numbers: +54,000, +8,487, a pink **−13,974**, and then \"66,5…\" cut off at the edge. Under that it says \"לחשבון נכנסים קודם 50,719 ₪, והקרן מעבירה 29,768 ₪ למס הכנסה\". So almost 30k goes to tax?? That scared me. Then something about getting 15,794 back. At the bottom it says \"נשאר בידיים 66,601 ₪ עד 66,280 ₪\". That's the number I'm taking with me, but I'm honestly not sure if it's for year 5 or year 6.\n- **Where I stopped:** \"שווה לדעת\" and \"מי מציע ומי מצטרף\". I stopped there.\n\n**What I skipped:** The grey notes about inflation and \"בכסף של היום\", the \"חוקים וכללים\" chips, the \"כדאי להכיר גם\" buttons, the toggle between שכירים and עצמאים, and the \"חשבון ניירות ערך\" link.\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"מסלול מדד\", \"התשואה הוספה אחרי דמי ניהול\", \"קופת גמל\", \"החזר ממס הכנסה\", \"(13245)\", and \"11 המסלולים\".\n\n**What I'd change:** Don't start the chart at 5 years when the whole point is 6. Out of nowhere you get hit with a pink minus and a 29,768 ₪ tax. Show one big \"you get X after 6 years\" number at the top, so I don't have to work out which bar is mine."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3785,"cache_read_input_tokens":9979,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3785},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"39f1a14b-d432-47bb-a92b-53536280c672","uuid":"0bc5187e-8375-478c-8431-39ab319a5071","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:14:02.353Z","request_id":"req_011CgkdUwkWm2iZrLr79QQho"}
